APOLLO_TEXT("InstructionSamples", "Namunaga yaqinlashing. E bilan foto oling, keyin E ni ushlab qadoqlang. Q boshqa manzilni tanlaydi.", "Approach a sample. Tap E for a photo, then hold E to seal it. Q selects another site.")
APOLLO_TEXT("InstructionTraverse", "Surveyor 3 tomon o‘zingizga qulay yo‘lni tanlang. Tab xaritani ochadi; Shift tezroq yurgizadi.", "Choose your route to Surveyor 3. Tab opens the map; Shift gives a faster stride.")
APOLLO_TEXT("InstructionSurveyorPhoto", "Surveyor 3 ga yaqin boring. Qurilmaga qarab E bilan umumiy foto oling.", "Walk close to Surveyor 3. Look at the spacecraft and tap E for a context photo.")
APOLLO_TEXT("InstructionSurveyorParts", "Kamera, kurak yoki kabel belgisiga qarang. E ni ushlab uni qadoqlang. Q manzilni almashtiradi.", "Look at a camera, scoop or cable marker. Hold E to pack it. Q changes the marker.")
APOLLO_TEXT("InstructionReturn", "Intrepid asboblari belgisiga qayting. Stolga qarab E ni ushlab barcha yukni topshiring.", "Return to the Intrepid field kit. Look at the table and hold E to stow the cargo.")
