APOLLO_TEXT("JournalPlanText", "Intrepid → ALSEP → Head, Bench, Sharp namunalari → Surveyor 3 → Intrepid. Namunalarni istalgan tartibda yig‘ish mumkin.", "Intrepid → ALSEP → Head, Bench and Sharp samples → Surveyor 3 → Intrepid. Samples can be collected in any order.")
APOLLO_TEXT("JournalRouteText", "Ko‘k chiziq Conradning qayta tiklangan tarixiy yo‘li. Siz unga majburiy bog‘lanmagansiz. Oltin belgilar ish joylarini ko‘rsatadi.", "The cyan line is Conrad's reconstructed historical traverse. You may choose your own route. Gold marks work sites.")
APOLLO_TEXT("JournalStats", "BOSILGAN YO‘L  {Distance} m     NAMUNALAR  {Count}/3", "WALKED  {Distance} m     SAMPLES  {Count}/3")
APOLLO_TEXT("TaskCheckout", "Intrepid yonida tayyorgarlik", "Intrepid checkout")
APOLLO_TEXT("TaskDeploy", "ALSEP ni joylashtirish", "Deploy ALSEP")
APOLLO_TEXT("TaskSamples", "Uch namunani hujjatlashtirish", "Document three samples")
APOLLO_TEXT("TaskTraverse", "Surveyor 3 ga borish", "Reach Surveyor 3")
APOLLO_TEXT("TaskRecover", "Qurilma qismlarini olish", "Retrieve Surveyor hardware")
APOLLO_TEXT("TaskReturn", "Yuk bilan Intrepidga qaytish", "Return with the evidence")
APOLLO_TEXT("JournalHistory", "2 / HAQIQIY EKSPEDITSIYA", "2 / A REAL EXPEDITION")
APOLLO_TEXT("HistoryCrew", "1969-yil noyabr. Pete Conrad va Alan Bean Oy yuzasida ishladi; Richard Gordon Oy orbitasida qoldi.", "November 1969. Pete Conrad and Alan Bean worked on the surface while Richard Gordon remained in lunar orbit.")
APOLLO_TEXT("HistoryLightning", "Uchish paytida ikki marta chaqmoq urdi. Signalni moslashtirish qurilmasini zaxira holatiga o‘tkazish telemetriyani tiklashga yordam berdi.", "Two lightning strikes occurred during launch. Switching the signal-conditioning equipment to its auxiliary setting helped restore telemetry.")
APOLLO_TEXT("HistorySurveyor", "Intrepid 1967-yilda kelgan Surveyor 3 yaqiniga qo‘ndi. Uning qismlari Oy muhitida turgan uskunalarni o‘rganish uchun qaytarildi.", "Intrepid landed near Surveyor 3, which arrived in 1967. Returned parts let researchers study hardware exposed to the lunar environment.")
APOLLO_TEXT("HistorySources", "Manbalar: NASA Apollo 12 / NASA JPL", "Sources: NASA Apollo 12 / NASA JPL")
APOLLO_TEXT("JournalEvidence", "3 / DALILLAR NIMA UCHUN KERAK?", "3 / WHAT YOUR EVIDENCE MEANS")
APOLLO_TEXT("EvidencePhoto", "Namuna olinmasdan oldingi foto uning atrofini qayd etadi. Yorliq qopni olingan joy bilan bog‘laydi.", "A photo records context before a sample is disturbed. A label connects the bag to its collection site.")
APOLLO_TEXT("EvidenceSamples", "Joylar va ID lar: 12031, 12032 va 12027 kerni. Tosh shakllari o‘yin uchun yaratilgan, asl namunalarning skani emas.", "Mapped sites identify 12031, 12032 and the 12027 core. Rock shapes are illustrative, not scans of the original samples.")
APOLLO_TEXT("EvidenceParts", "Kamera, kurak va kabel — Yerda tekshiriladigan fizik dalillar. Surveyor ta’mirlanmaydi va ishlaydigan roverga aylantirilmaydi.", "The camera, scoop and cable are physical evidence for study on Earth. Surveyor is not repaired or returned as a working rover.")
APOLLO_TEXT("EvidenceSources", "Manbalar: LROC marshrut arxivi / NASA JPL", "Sources: LROC traverse archive / NASA JPL")
APOLLO_TEXT("JournalSources", "4 / MANBALAR VA TALQIN", "4 / SOURCES AND ADAPTATION")
APOLLO_TEXT("SourcesTerrain", "Relyef: NASA LRO / LROC NAC_DTM_APOLLO12, 2 m qadam. Joylar va yo‘llar: Apollo 12 mapping arxivi, Gonzales va boshqalar (2020).", "Terrain: NASA LRO / LROC NAC_DTM_APOLLO12, 2 m spacing. Sites and traverse: Apollo 12 mapping archive, Gonzales et al. (2020).")
APOLLO_TEXT("SourcesAccuracy", "Balandliklar stereo tasvirlardan hisoblangan. 2 m qadam mutlaq aniqlik degani emas. Xaritadagi surat 2010-yilda olingan.", "Elevation is derived from stereo images. Grid spacing is not absolute accuracy. The orbital reference image was acquired in 2010.")
APOLLO_TEXT("SourcesAdaptation", "Ikki tarixiy EVA bitta o‘yinga jamlangan. Vaqt, ish davomiyligi, kichik toshlar, modellar, yoritish va radio matni o‘yin uchun moslashtirilgan.", "Two historical EVAs are condensed into one chapter. Time limits, task durations, small rocks, models, lighting and radio text are game adaptations.")
APOLLO_TEXT("SourcesLinks", "To‘liq havolalar va manifest: paketdagi Credits papkasi", "Full links and manifest: the package Credits folder")
APOLLO_TEXT("PauseTitle", "EKSPEDITSIYA PAUZADA", "EXPEDITION PAUSED")
APOLLO_TEXT("WinTitle", "DALILLAR INTREPIDGA QAYTDI", "THE EVIDENCE IS HOME")
APOLLO_TEXT("LostTitle", "MASHQ YAKUNLANDI", "EXERCISE ENDED")
APOLLO_TEXT("BriefTitle", "SURVEYOR MEROSI", "SURVEYOR'S LEGACY")
