APOLLO_TEXT("BriefStory", "1969-yil. Oy namunalarini va Surveyor 3 qismlarini Yerda o‘rganish uchun olib qayting.", "1969. Return lunar samples and Surveyor 3 hardware for study on Earth.")
APOLLO_TEXT("BriefRoute", "Asboblarni joylashtiring, uch namunani yig‘ing va Surveyorga boring. So‘ng barcha yukni Intrepidga qaytaring.", "Deploy the instruments, collect three samples and visit Surveyor. Bring all the evidence back to Intrepid.")
APOLLO_TEXT("BriefAdaptation", "NASA relyefi asosida. Ikki tarixiy EVA bitta 20–30 daqiqalik bobga jamlangan. 30 daqiqa — mashq limiti.", "NASA-derived terrain. Two historical EVAs condensed into a 20–30 minute chapter. The 30-minute timer is an exercise limit.")
APOLLO_TEXT("BriefHelp", "Boshqaruv o‘yin ichida o‘rgatiladi. Tab xarita va yordamni ochadi.", "Controls are introduced as you play. Tab opens the map and guidance.")
APOLLO_TEXT("Begin", "ENTER / BOSISH  Ekspeditsiyani boshlash", "ENTER / CLICK  Begin the expedition")
APOLLO_TEXT("PauseText", "Yurish, ish va mashq vaqti to‘xtatilgan.", "Movement, work and the exercise clock are paused.")
APOLLO_TEXT("PauseMap", "TAB / J  Xarita, vazifalar va tarix", "TAB / J  Map, tasks and history")
APOLLO_TEXT("Resume", "ESC / ENTER / BOSISH  Davom ettirish", "ESC / ENTER / CLICK  Resume expedition")
APOLLO_TEXT("WinText", "Oy namunalari va Surveyor qismlari topshirildi. Tarixiy ekipaj ularni keyinchalik Yerga qaytardi.", "Lunar samples and Surveyor hardware are stowed. The historical crew later returned them to Earth for study.")
APOLLO_TEXT("WinCargo", "[+] ALSEP    [+] 3 NAMUNA    [+] KAMERA / KURAK / KABEL", "[+] ALSEP    [+] 3 SAMPLES    [+] CAMERA / SCOOP / CABLE")
