APOLLO_TEXT("WinContext", "Bob yukni topshirish bilan tugaydi. Uchish, orbitadagi uchrashuv va Yerga qaytish bu o‘yinda boshqarilmaydi.", "This chapter ends at cargo stowage. Ascent, rendezvous and Earth return are historical context beyond the playable route.")
APOLLO_TEXT("Again", "R / ENTER  Qayta o‘ynash", "R / ENTER  Explore again")
APOLLO_TEXT("LostHelp", "Xaritadan foydalaning va qaytishga vaqt qoldiring. Tab yoki pauza mashq vaqtini ham to‘xtatadi.", "Use the map and leave time for the return. The journal and pause also stop the exercise clock.")
APOLLO_TEXT("Restart", "R / ENTER  Qayta boshlash", "R / ENTER  Restart expedition")
